                "quoted_status_profile_username": "Acyn",
                "reply_count": 1136,
                "retweet_count": 776,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Undocumented immigrants are not eligible for the ACA. Period.\n\nTrump keeps repeating this lie to hide the truth:\n\nIf ACA tax credits aren\u2019t extended as Democrats are demanding, ACA health insurance premiums will spike by 114%.",
