                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 17,
                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Democrats are fighting to extend the ACA\u2019s enhanced tax credits because if Congress fails to act immediately, hundreds of thousands of Americans will lose their health care, and millions more will see their premiums skyrocket by an average of 114%.\n\nA 60-year-old couple making $80,000 a year would see their annual health care costs jump by more than $17,000.\n\nCosts are already soaring under Trump\u2019s failed leadership. Health care would be one more thing to add to that list.",
                "text_lang": "en",
