                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Instead of working with Democrats to stop these crushing cost increases, Republicans are refusing to negotiate and blocking action, choosing politics over the health and financial security of millions of American families. \n\nhttps://t.co/pVcBRjKV4Q",
