                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The government has been shutdown for two full weeks. Federal workers are still working and have started to miss paychecks.\n\nMeanwhile, @SpeakerJohnson and House Republicans are continuing their 4-week long vacation. \n\nDemocrats are still fighting for affordable health care for American families. Republicans \u2014 get back to work.",
