                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": ".@SpeakerJohnson has kept the House in session for only 20 days over the last 16 weeks.\n\nIt\u2019s long past time for him to bring the House back to work to end this shutdown, protect Americans from crippling health insurance hikes, and finally pass some bipartisan bills that actually help working families for a change.",
