                "text": "With open enrollment for the ACA just 11 days away, @SpeakerJohnson must call the House back to Washington to protect Americans\u2019 health care and end this shutdown.\n\nRepublicans need to act now to prevent 114% premium hikes and stop millions of Americans from losing coverage.",
