                "reply_count": 162,
                "retweet_count": 27,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "At day 36, today marks the longest government shutdown in history.\n\nACA health care premiums are doubling and our most vulnerable are going hungry without SNAP benefits.\n\n@SpeakerJohnson and Republicans need to come to the negotiation table and end the shutdown now.",
